# Breakdown Bend (CIPlay vi_breakdown_bend; VI1 vehicle island): quest "Out of Road", the five steps in order
island Breakdown Bend
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Out of Road
expect hidden roofbox
zone camp
expect step 1
read Driver's log
expect step 2
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0
expect step 3
use stuckvan
expect message fan belt is gone
open Spares crate
wait 2
expect story fanbelt 1
use stuckvan
expect story vanfixed 1
expect shown roofbox
expect step 4
open Driver's roof box
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
expect done
